OL,3,GNEWSARoad reopens after extensive
OL,4,Aviaduct repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major road has reopened after
OL,7,Fextensive repair work was carried out
OL,8,Fto a viaduct.
OL,10,FBuilt in the 1930s, the 0.26-mile
OL,11,F(420m) Irthlingborough viaduct carries
OL,12,Fthe A6 over the River Nene, linking the
OL,13,Ftowns of Irthlingborough and Rushden.
OL,15,FNorth Northamptonshire Council said a
OL,16,Fseries of closures had to be introduced
OL,17,Fafter tests in May "deemed the bridge
OL,18,Fto be in a poorer condition than
OL,19,Finitially expected".
