OL,3,GNEWSARoad reopens after extensive
OL,4,Aviaduct repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to "ensure the long-term integrity
OL,7,Fof the structure" included
OL,8,Fwaterproofing and replacing some
OL,9,Fexpansion joints, and was completed
OL,10,Flast weekend.
